# Snort IDS is default-on for every x86 image (build-x86-host-stage4.sh appends
# net-analyzer/snort to PKGS unless --no-snort). The 2.9.x branch is still ~amd64
# in the tree, so without this keyword the packages.list emerge aborts up front
# ("All ebuilds that could satisfy net-analyzer/snort have been masked") and the
# whole node payload — kubelet/kubeadm/containerd/grub/dracut/parted — never merges.
net-analyzer/snort ~amd64
